BIG HUGE REDICULOUS DETAILED SPOILER warning.



The assumption of this list is that food should be eaten in reverse weight
order, i.e.  the food with the least nutrition/weight should be eaten first
and the food with the most nutrition/weight should be eaten last.  There
are exceptions and exceptional circumstances, so this is just a rough guide.

The list is set up in groups, such that things with similar nutritions/weight
are set up together.  Most things weigh only one, things that weigh more and
have a similary multiplied nutrition are marked with (?x).

Eat things from the top down, if at all possible.

	Tins

	Fortune Cookies
	Clove of Garlic		(Scares vampires if you hit them with it.)
	Dead Lizards		(Reverses slow turning to stone.)

	Apple
	Carrot
	Pear

	Egg			(May hatch into a useful/dangerous creature)
	Orange

	Melon
	Tripe (2x)		(50% chance of vomiting.)
	Cream Pie
	Candy Bar

	Lump of Royal Jelly	(Restore/adds to strength)
	Pancake
	Cram Ration (3x)
	Food Ration (4x)

	Slime Mold

	C-Ration		(3/8ths of a food ration)

	K-Ration		(Half a food ration)

	Lemas Wafers		(Food ration in a pill)

